  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Bring a medium saucepan of salted water to the boil. Cut broccoli (including the stalk!) into small florets. Finely chop garlic. Thinly slice herbs.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6255244ecae2dd3806157475/step-9814d080.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cook fusilli and broccoli in the boiling water until pasta is al dente and broccoli is tender, 8 minutes.\n• Place mixed leaves in a colander, then drain fusilli and broccoli over leaves. Set aside.\n• TIP: 'Al dente' pasta is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.\n• TIP: Placing the mixed leaves in the colander before draining the pasta is an easy trick to wilt it!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6255244ecae2dd3806157475/step-451fd45d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the pasta is cooking, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook panko breadcrumbs (see ingredients) until lightly browned, 2-3 minutes. Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 30 seconds. Add flaked almonds and a pinch of chilli flakes (if using). Season with salt and pepper. Transfer to a small bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6255244ecae2dd3806157475/step-e5a66d81.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the pasta and greens are cooked, return the saucepan to medium heat. Melt the butter. Add cornflour (see ingredients) and cook, stirring, until 'raw' smell is cooked off, 1 minute. Slowly pour in light cooking cream and the milk and whisk to combine. Cook, stirring constantly, until thickened slightly, 30 seconds. Add vegetable stock powder, garlic & herb seasoning, shredded Cheddar cheese, grated Parmesan cheese and a pinch of pepper. Continue stirring until cheese is melted into a smooth sauce.\n• TIP: Loosen with a dash more milk if the sauce looks too thick.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6255244ecae2dd3806157475/step-ec1ffa80.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add cooked fusilli, broccoli and mixed leaves to the cheesy sauce. Toss to coat. Stir through herbs.\n• Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6255244ecae2dd3806157475/step-5affa29a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the cheesy fusilli and greens between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with garlic-almond pangrattato to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6255244ecae2dd3806157475/step-4c2a1169.jpg"
    }
  ]
